# Under Opalescence, Oubliette is a 3/3 creature (each other non-Aura enchantment is a creature with base power and toughness
# equal to its mana value), the only creature there is, so its "When this enchantment enters, target creature phases out until
# this enchantment leaves the battlefield" must target itself. It phases out until it leaves the battlefield - but a phased-out
# permanent has not left (CR 702.26d), so it never phases in: not in Bot1's untap step (CR 610.4a), nor ever after (CR 610.4).

